{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a fourth-year university student who \u201chasn\u2019t found what they truly want to do,\u201d starts working part-time at a bar where travelers gather during spring break.<br>Through encounters with unique travelers, they come into contact with diverse lifestyles and values\u2014and eventually, discover their own path in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three main characters are based on real Japanese people:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rieko Ayumi</strong>, a celebrity who has traveled to 98 countries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A traveler who experienced a <strong>working holiday in France</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>game developer</strong> who loves traveling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By listening to their stories, what will the protagonist learn\u2014and how will they choose to live?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:\u00a0</strong>This work is a piece of fiction based on real-life experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game System</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conversations After Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/7f1e9ec08ffe927db2b79a50d6050424.avif?t=1768264620\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing a shift, you can talk with customers and staff.<br>The closer you become, the deeper the conversations you can have.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learning Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/fe945bf4acd6206838a2c7bb86441372.avif?t=1768264620\" width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist keeps notes on the lessons they learn from each conversation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Signboard Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/9b5e7031fb90f8039334e158c3febf12.avif?t=1768264620\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re also in charge of designing the bar\u2019s signboard.<br>Talk with everyone and reflect your growth through your design.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background Gallery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/36c062c9c00140d0fbeabc763dbcaff2.avif?t=1768264620\" width=1560 height=869 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 70% of the backgrounds in this game were created using AI.<br>In the Background Gallery, you can view the scenery from around the world featured in the story.<br>Backgrounds generated with AI are marked with a special tag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Rieko Ayumi\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/d41ed3d59815f5977bd17d5d9b87354e.avif?t=1768264620\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A celebrity who has traveled to 98 countries.<br>She speaks passionately about her journey around the world\u2014<br>and has even experienced dangerous incidents abroad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Kenty\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/05018745d354a274fae8011d82ef4553.avif?t=1768264620\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has worked in the <strong>Philippines</strong>, stayed long-term in <strong>Georgia</strong>,<br>and experienced a <strong>working holiday in France</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Bell\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/ff65c93a218076063326b5c1899610ff.avif?t=1768264620\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bar\u2019s owner and a travel-loving game developer.<br>Loves <strong>Taiwan</strong> and often travels there solo.<br>They say she\u2019s a bit scary when she gets angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trailer Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video Production: Karin Bell  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video Materials: Mirin </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975150?t=1768264620","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975150?t=1768264620","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/432a2992d028125810de04e77b029a850af529a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768264620","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/432a2992d028125810de04e77b029a850af529a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768264620","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The character talks about their experience of being involved in a violent crime."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a fourth-year university student who \u201chasn\u2019t found what they truly want to do,\u201d star